        "name": "pc-transfer-03",
        "description": "Raw lag may omit or contain any JSON value. Accept exact integers -1..8 inclusive (not bool/float). Always result={accepted:boolean,lag:original if accepted else null}; invalid/missing return false/null without exceptions or coercion. Target typed-inputs interface requires selected-runner support; unapproved draft, not submitted or activated.",
